      "walkthrough": [
        "Set the rate of change of $y$ equal to $\\frac{5}{8}\\text{ units/min}$:\n$$\\frac{dy}{dt} = \\frac{dy}{dx} \\times \\frac{dx}{dt} = \\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{5x - 1}} \\times 2 = \\frac{5}{\\sqrt{5x - 1}} = \\frac{5}{8}$$",
        "Solve for $\\sqrt{5x - 1}$ and square both sides:\n$$\\sqrt{5x - 1} = 8 \\implies 5x - 1 = 64$$",
